          "text": "Opus 5 is live in Claude Code and the Claude Platform today. A few things worth knowing: 🧵 Claude (@claudeai) Introducing Claude Opus 5. It's a thoughtful and proactive model that comes close to the frontier intelligence of Fable 5 at half the price. Video — https://nitter.net/claudeai/status/2080699495453528290#m",
