          "text": "Whether you’re on the left or the right, stop for two seconds. I’m going to tell you how we all got scammed. Not “the rich.” Not “the bosses.” Not “the bad guys.” A structure. After 1945, a class figured out something brilliant: you could live extremely well by presenting yourself as the permanent protectors of the oppressed. They didn’t seize power with guns. They seized it with morality. They told the people: “We’re going to make your lives better.” And while they said it, they captured the state, the universities, the media, the NGOs, the international organizations, and finally language it",
