          "text": "Microsoft just validated the multi-model bet. Satya's latest post on MAI: route every task to the cheapest model that clears the quality floor, using frontier only when needed. That's the exact thesis behind Kilo's Auto Efficient: 71% of frontier completion at 72% lower cost, no custom models required. Full breakdown: blog.kilo.ai/p/microsofts-ma…",
